Spec: Persistent pending registration verification

Purpose:
  Verify caller-scoped registration transactions and RPC integration using temporary private state.

Owns:
  ./RegistrationTests.cs

Must:
  Cover restart retries, changed parameters, caller separation, capacity, rollback and unsupported privileged operations.
  Exercise registration over a real pipe and remove only owned temporary test state.
  Kill an owned child with an uncommitted SQLite transaction and verify recovery without partial registration.
